=00_AQBIlUX5FzrEaPBRTJ9R4CVBpAMz6VesM1NgHLFtDaRvGw&oe=6A61FDA3"}, {"file_name": "screenshoot (2).png", "id": "1918923742338656", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618251_1918923745671989_8890095879017026427_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LNaImzh3Do0Q7kNvwFZ3Z5b&_nc_oc=Adr1DcujVuO35MT8mzxq9Nt2A45u_P8rbT8sZFh6wxbShj5XZj2RUKIXXYz1FAy5dco&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAlHG8BCo8BaAG5hjbw3zJXLY0NlgtLNuqw8eR1fXve-w&oe=6A61FFFA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "KV\u5efa\u6a21\u7248-\u6a2a\u7248\u5e26\u6587\u6848.png", "id": "2933852970137565", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499617850_2933852973470898_1269573226902913604_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bvDoHBDVF3YQ7kNvwGEiSHj&_nc_oc=AdozIQCLSvM0pvGvBt4K7HTeEd0pNspmRAzgckhGCF5UualM1Z0hdY2p4_Fg7HD88Mw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBqnwxCbc8KxUyI9p9xB4ygcmtuoZxI0ScI8tGoXW63BQ&oe=6A6218A1"}, "display_name": "Grab & Run Alpaca party", "keywords": ["hangout", "multiplayer"], "long_description": "##  This is ** Grab & Run**, the physics-powered extraction multiplayer VR adventure where maps reshape every time, every stuff has real weight, monsters keep you alert, and an upgrade system makes each run hit even better, while you and your friends stay just the right amount of chaotic, and new surprises drop all the time.\n\n---\n---\n\n\n## \ud83c\udf92 **Grab \u2192 Fight \u2192 Return Loop**\nEnter room \u2192 grab shiny stuff \u2192 fight monsters \u2192 push stuff home, classic extraction loop, Alpaca edition.  \nThe more valuable the grab, the harder it gets.  **High risk. Big shiny.**\n\n---\n{1410467900510234}\n\n## \u2699\ufe0f **Physics Chaos**\nEverything heavy. Everything move. Push cart fast, stuff fly off.  \nNot bug, physics working hard.  Too heavy? Roll it into cart. \n\nEfficiency? Maybe. Fun? Definitely.\n\n---\n{1579468509903297}\n\n## \ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f **Every run is a new world**\nNew room combos, new routes, new monsters, every single run.  \nYou might get a little lost and run into wandering monsters, just consider it part of the adventure.\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udc79 **Many Monster. Then BIG BOSS.**\nDifferent monsters wander around.  Every few levels, big boss show up.  \nGet friends and fight together. Fun.\n\n---\n{847706171298747}\n\n## \ud83d\udcaa **Get coins, get stronger**\nGrab coins to upgrade your stats, boost your runs, and become big strong alpaca.  \nMore gear, more builds, more chaos coming.  **Final form not reached yet.**\n\n\n{25371341385839390}\n---\n## \ud83d\udd27 **Feedback & Updates**\nWe update the game often and keep improving it based on your feedback.  \nYou speak, we hear. Join our Discord, play with the community:  \n**discord.gg/fXzg8gwrpr**\n\n\n", "short_description": "This is Grab & Run, the physics-powered extraction multiplayer VR adventure where maps reshape every time, every stuff has real weight, monsters keep you alert, and an upgrade system makes each run hit even better, while you and your friends stay just the right amount of chaotic, new surprises drop all the time."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1G2lTbooVez5146G8ER7dBPNAw-xLTALwRUWbCwmp9j4/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Netvios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://netvios.163.com/en/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "1700921480735423"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": [], "id": "25407354645602759"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1562344358151926"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1562344358151926"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1769166780, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1562344358151926"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "27368217539516450", "version": "1.14.30"}, "id": "4201197503539639", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "24653500707654827", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27368217539516450"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "4201197503539639"}]}, "change_log": "New Features  \nSlotMachine System  \nCustom Black Screen Function \nOptimization and improvements  \nAI and monsters  \nHall lighting adjustment, fixed floating warehouse crates issue, optimized tutorial portal \nBug Fixes  \nFixed issues where blood pots do not affect monsters, monster states fail to take effect, and characters remain red after being hit.  \nFixed synchronization issues with the little girl's animation, gene device, and search/attack data updates.  \nFixed errors in custom black screen following and malfunctioning skip function.  \nFixed abnormal elite monster generation and patrol behavior.  \nFixed reversed settings for running speed and movement speed, as well as PT monster initialization anomalies. \nResource and Content Update  \nUpdated in-game ship models  \nUpdated search, attack, and retreat item images, added starfield particle effects", "created_date": 1783697069, "id": "27368217539516450", "version": "1.14.30", "version_code": 369, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "27368210756183795"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "24653500707654827", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27368217539516450"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "4201197503539639"}]}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1781705008, "id": "27108110718860468", "version": "1.14.22", "version_code": 360, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "27108101082194765"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "24653500707654827", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27368217539516450"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "4201197503539639"}]}, "change_log": "1\u3001Fixed an issue where the Creator's Booth in the Lobby was malfunctioning.\n2\u3001Fixed occlusion culling, collision, and leaderboard out-of-bounds issues in the Lobby.\n3\u3001Optimized pegboard placement position for the best fit in personal rooms.\n4\u3001Fixed a possible model anomaly when transitioning from the Base to the Lobby.\n5\u3001Fixed an issue where item quantities did not refresh after retrieving items from the spaceship warehouse upon retreat.\n6\u3001Fixed a rare issue where the backpack drag button would become stuck.", "created_date": 1781087636, "id": "27018796961125178", "version": "1.14.17", "version_code": 353, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "27018789007792640"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "24653500707654827", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27368217539516450"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "4201197503539639"}]}, "change_log": "New system/function added\nTarget shooting game: A new target shooting gameplay has been added in the hall, along with dedicated pistols\nGenetic device: A new genetic device has been added to the personal base, supporting numerical offset and back-end access\nForging Table: Complete forging System (including special effects, hints, and grid repair)\nUpgrade device: The model configuration is complete and supports item upgrades\nMining machine: Complete Functions (Animation, special effects, collision)\nWarehouse Box: A new prototype of warehouse box has been added to personal Home, supporting classified display and expansion\nPrivate elevator: Seamless switching between the lobby and personal base, with elevator door animation\nPersonal Room: Complete scene and functional panel (Mobile animation, warehouse, forging table, etc.)\n\nInteraction and UI improvement\nMarketing button: Position update, added vibration feedback, fixed bug of not being able to press\nSpace grid: Displays item name, usage/total capacity, stroke distinction (treasure/material/food)\nPrompt system: New default prompts, recovery time prompts, forging table/upgrade table/gold attribute table prompts have been added\nMultilingual: Extensive updates, multilingual supplementation of search, fight and drop items\nJoystick: Minimum sensitivity 20%, with a new setting for movement accuracy added\nSmooth rotation: Parameters are adjustable, supporting the setting of instantaneous rotation angles\nUI panel: Hall HUD panel integration, private room panel update, ranking list UI optimization\n\nLevels and Scenes\nHall: Fully renovated, seamlessly connected to the base, unnecessary buttons/scripts removed, and new mute panels and marketing information desks added\nPersonal Base: Lighting adjustment, pegboard update, independent loading of scene resources\nLevel difficulty: Adjust the difficulty configuration of Maps 1, 2, and 3", "created_date": 1780688388, "id": "26964004876604387", "version": "1.14.15", "version_code": 348, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "26963997813271760"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "24653500707654827", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27368217539516450"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "4201197503539639"}]}, "change_log": "1. Added creator badge display stand and related activities in the lobby.\n2. Added comment button and related rewards in the lobby.\n3. Added an option to skip the beginner tutorial.", "created_date": 1778743082, "id": "26678032358534975", "version": "1.13.36", "version_code": 328, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "26678022941869250"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}